n &= 2^{18}5^{0}, 2^{14}5^{1}, 2^{10}5^{2}, 2^{6}5^{3}, 2^{2}5^{4}, 2^{4}3^{4}, 2^{2}3^{2}5^{2}, 2^{2}3^{8}
\end{align*} The sum of the above is $65520$. </think> <answer> $3276$ </answer>

